MACRO PREF                                                                      
*****************************************************************               
*                                                               *               
* RS FILE, IS CREATED IN W85005 AND USED IN W85006              *               
*                                                               *               
* RECORD LENGTH 60                                                              
*                                                               *               
* ALL FIELDS ARE NUMERICAL.                                     *               
* EXCEPTION  KDVSOP CAN HAVE THE VALUE BLANK (=SPACES)          *               
*****************************************************************               
*                                                                               
   &PREF.RECORD                                      1    60 A                  
     &PREF.RECTYP                                    1     2 P  0               
*                           ** RECORD TYPE = 004                                
     &PREF.IDARTNR                                   3     5 P  0               
*                           ** PART NO, WITHOUT CHECK DIGIT                     
     &PREF.KDVSOP                                    8     3 A                  
*                           ** V.S.O.P CODE                                     
       &PREF.KDVSOP1                                 8     1 P  0               
       &PREF.KDVSOP2                                 9     1 P  0               
       &PREF.KDVSOP3                                10     1 P  0               
     &PREF.IDFKNGRP                                 11     3 P  0               
*                           ** FUNCTION GROUP                                   
     &PREF.VLARTNTO                                 14     5 P  1               
*                           ** VOLUME PER ITEM, CM3                             
     &PREF.VKART                                    19     4 P  0               
*                           ** WEIGHT PER ITEM, GRAM                            
     &PREF.ADLOCAL                                  23     4 P  0               
*                           ** LOCAL LOCATION                                   
     &PREF.BEART-SVE                                27    15 A                  
     &PREF.BEART-ENG                                42    15 A                  
*                           ** BENÄMNINGAR **                                   
     &PREF.KDVVKL                                   57     1 P  0               
*                           ** VOLYMKLASS **                                    
     &PREF.TIFINLV                                  58     3 P  0               
*                           ** FÖRSTA INLEVERANS **                             
*** END COPY W850004E                LENGTH =       60                          
